      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Low temperature promotes deformation twinning in the Co-free alloy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "High strain rate promotes deformation twinning in the Co-free alloy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Under the proposed temperature and strain-rate regime, Co removal shifts the dominant deformation mechanism from conventional dislocation slip toward enhanced deformation twinning.",
