      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Twin-mediated impediment of dislocation motion increases work hardening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enhanced work hardening delays strain localization and failure.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "At low temperature and high strain rate, Co-free FeNiCrMn will have a higher deformation-twin density than equiatomic CoCrFeMnNi tested under equivalent conditions.",
