      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "At low temperature and high strain rate, Co-free FeNiCrMn will have a higher strain-hardening rate than equiatomic CoCrFeMnNi.",
